# Outfit body (R18): light armour: an angular chest plate standing off the torso, three ab plates, big steel pauldrons
# projecting past both shoulders over the upper arms (the silhouette the vest lacks), accent spine stripe and a
# glowing status light. Torso inside x 1..7, y 3..11 (pivot 4 7 0 on spine_03).
name outfit_armour
grid 5
size 10 14 12
slot plate SwatchMain
slot steel Steel
slot stripe SwatchAccent
slot light SwatchGlow
shell 0 2 1 8 12 10 1 plate
carve box 1 3 1 7 11 9
carve box 2 5 9 6 9 10
poly 6 10 plate 7,3 9,2 10,4 10,10 9,12 7,11
box 8 4 1 9 10 2 plate
box 8 4 3 9 10 4 plate
box 8 4 5 9 10 6 plate
ellipsoid 4 1.8 9 3.8 2.2 2.4 steel
ellipsoid 4 12.2 9 3.8 2.2 2.4 steel
box 1 0 6 7 1 8 steel
box 1 13 6 7 14 8 steel
carve box 1 3 6 7 11 10
paint box 9 6 6 10 8 10 stripe
box 9 3 8 10 4 9 light
box 0 2 0 8 12 1 steel
pivot 4 7 0
